CVE-2025-69720 exp:2026-06-27

# CVE-2026-0994: Denial of service in Python protobuf.
# Why no fix: Transitive dependency of moto/gcs in test runner; pip resolver cannot handle direct upgrade due to depth limit.
# Why not exploitable: The test runner is short-lived and only executed in secure development/CI environments.
CVE-2026-0994 exp:2026-06-27

